{# HtmlRawBlock view — renders stored markup verbatim (trusted editors).

   The wrapper is a styling hook, not a change of contract: the stored markup
   still comes out untouched, it just gains an element kit.css can scope to.
   Without it this block was the one place editor-authored <img> could land
   with nothing the kit is allowed to select on. #}
<div class="cb-block-html-raw">{{ data.html|default('')|raw }}</div>
